# **Centurion Business Accommodation**

Centrally located between Pretoria and Johannesburg, Centurion is one of Gauteng's most practical bases for business travel.&nbsp; Direct access to the N1, N14 and R21 puts Pretoria, Midrand, Sandton and OR Tambo International Airport within easy reach.&nbsp; For business travellers covering multiple meetings across Gauteng in a single day, that central position is a genuine practical advantage.

Centurion is home to established commercial, corporate and business areas, while the Gautrain provides an additional transport link for professionals travelling within Gauteng. &nbsp;The area is well suited to business travellers attending meetings, training, conferences, projects and work assignments in Centurion and the surrounding business centres.

Whether you're travelling to Centurion for business, or need a convenient base within reach of Pretoria, Midrand or Johannesburg, browse ACOSA's curated selection of business-friendly guesthouses in Centurion.
